OL,3,GNEWSAOwners of flats told to pay #38k
OL,4,Aeach for repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents living in a seafront tower
OL,7,Fblock have been told they will have to
OL,8,Fpay nearly #38,000 each for "essential
OL,9,Frepairs".
OL,11,FA tribunal has ruled leaseholders with
OL,12,Fflats at Arlington House, Margate, will
OL,13,Fhave to hand over the money to the
OL,14,Fowner, Freshwater. The owners of 106
OL,15,Fflats - including artist Dame Tracey
OL,16,FEmin - will pay in two instalments, one
OL,17,Fnext month and another in March 2027.
OL,19,FThe owners, Metropolitan Property
OL,20,FRealization Ltd (MPRL), part of the
OL,21,FFreshwater Group, declined to comment.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
