OL,3,GNEWSAOwners of flats told to pay #38k
OL,4,Aeach for repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, a company spokesman previously
OL,7,Ftold Thanet councillors the repairs
OL,8,Fwere necessary, adding: "We're not
OL,9,Finventing work that doesn't need to be
OL,10,Fdone."
